 "title": "E23: drafter-only INT8 copy of the shared lm_head and a hybrid INT8/BF16 drafter fc projection, on E22b",
 "outcome": "discard",
 "outcome_detail": "Repeatable but small gains on code decode (+1.0%) and C1 (+3.5% in suites, +1.7% in the matched 30-round probe) against small, same-direction losses on cold prefill (32K -2.5%, every suite below the E22b range), C2 (-2.0%) and C4 (-1.9%). An external review found no realistic variant with a clear win; the estimated ceiling after all proposed ablations was about +3% on code/C1. The owner closed the experiment; the service returned to E22b.",
 "reference": {
  "baseline_id": "2026-09-23-e22b",
