 "external_review": "Independent review (read-only, sanitized bundle): C2/C4 losses not established beyond noise; the 32K cold prefill deficit is the most credible cost, possibly from the direct F.linear fallback bypassing the vendor BF16 linear backend and from candidate selection on the INT8 head during chunked-prefill proposals. fc saves about 83 MB per step, not 168 MB. Proposed ablations (head-only, fc-only, vendor fallback, shape-limited dispatch) were not run.",
 "owner_decision": "close E23 and look for a larger lever"
}
